    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# ASTROHEALTH\n### 05 | Smart Triage & Escalation Watcher\n**Purpose:** creates evidence-grounded AI briefs and advances durable escalation timers.\n\n**Status:** inactive export; configure credentials and verify end-to-end behavior before activation. Backend owns jobs, due times, idempotency and escalation cancellation.",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 820
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4128,
        640
      ],
      "id": "3cea4beb-4e1a-4512-bae3-3229e91944f9",
      "name": "Workflow Overview"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01. AI Triage\nPoll pending jobs → retrieve only the incident context → Gemini structured JSON → backend validates evidence references before saving.\n\nIf Gemini returns an invalid response or fails, this workflow saves a deterministic fallback brief.",
        "height": 450,
        "width": 1192,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4560,
        864
      ],
      "id": "7e42c3b0-6df7-4657-9d9e-7805c954d44e",
      "name": "AI Triage Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02. Escalation\nPoll due rows → advance the durable backend escalation once with a deterministic request_id.\n\nThe backend cancels the active escalation when a doctor acknowledges the incident. The notification object built in this workflow is not delivered to a doctor; connect a verified notification channel separately if required.",
        "height": 306,
        "width": 1050,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        4592,
        1408
      ],
      "id": "64f8417a-7cea-4069-a6cb-fe3298e92212",
      "name": "Escalation Note"
    }
  ],
